# Canonical contributor identities.
#
# One person had committed under several git names — `mallison`, `mallison031`,
# and `Allison`, all on one email — which splits a single maintainer across
# three rows in `git shortlog`, GitHub's contributor graph, and most
# repo-analysis tooling, while understating everyone else's share. This file
# maps them back together retroactively without rewriting history.
#
# Verify with: git shortlog -sne

mallison <muyideenallison@gmail.com> <muyideenallison@gmail.com>
